QuestGuidance.Register("es",208,{
[6625]="7001CC67\n1\tPatrulla el camino al Gostannon\tEl camino hacia el Gostannon se encuentra al norte de Amon Angened y se dirige hacia el este. El primer punto de patrulla se encuentra al noroeste de Amon Angened, en el camino. Dannaswen te ha pedido que patrulles el camino hacia el Gostannon para determinar la fuerza del Enemigo allí.\n2\tPatrulla el camino al Gostannon\tEl camino hacia el Gostannon se encuentra al norte de Amon Angened y se dirige hacia el este. Dannaswen te ha pedido que patrulles el camino al Gostannon para determinar la fuerza del Enemigo en la zona.\n3\tPatrulla el camino al Gostannon\tEl camino hacia el Gostannon se encuentra al norte de Amon Angened y se dirige hacia el este. Dannaswen te ha pedido que patrulles el camino al Gostannon para determinar la fuerza del Enemigo en la zona.\n4\tPatrulla el camino al Gostannon\tEl camino hacia el Gostannon se encuentra al norte de Amon Angened y se dirige hacia el este. Dannaswen te ha pedido que patrulles el camino al Gostannon para determinar la fuerza del Enemigo en la zona.\n5\tPatrulla el camino al Gostannon\tEl camino hacia el Gostannon se encuentra al norte de Amon Angened y se dirige hacia el este. Dannaswen te ha pedido que patrulles el camino al Gostannon para determinar la fuerza del Enemigo en la zona.\n6\tHabla con Dannaswen en la cima de Amon Angened\tDannaswen se encuentra en el puesto élfico en la cima de Amon Angened, al sur del Gostannon. Deberías informarle inmediatamente.\n",
[6626]="7004E841\n1\tFind Dôm Goru\tDôm Goru can be found somewhere to the north-west of Furuk-mekhem, the Southgate. After learning that the Zhélruka have a small encampment named Dôm Goru in the eastern hills of the Ered Mithrin, Dori has asked you to ride ahead of the Company and learn if they know anything of Nori's expedition.\n2\tLearn if the Zhélruka at Dôm Goru encountered Nori's expedition\tDôm Goru can be found to the north-west of Furuk-mekhem, the Southgate in the Ered Mithrin. You have arrived at Dôm Goru and should now speak to the Zhélruka at the encampment and learn if they encountered Nori's expedition.\n3\tDefeat drakes and worms in the Grey Mountains (total: 14)\tDrakes and worms can be found throughout the Ered Mithrin. In exchange for information, Zádokh Flint-eye has asked you to defeat many of the drakes and worms of the Ered Mithrin.\n4\tTalk to Zádokh Flint-eye at Dôm Goru\tZádokh Flint-eye can be found at Dôm Goru in the Ered Mithrin. You have defeated many drakes and worms as Zádokh Flint-eye asked and should now return to him.\n5\tObtain a bag of gold coins\tBags of gold coins can be purchased at a Vault-keeper. In exchange for information, Zádokh Flint-eye has asked you to give him ten gold coins.\n6\tDeliver the bag of gold coins to Zádokh Flint-eye at Dôm Goru\tZádokh Flint-eye can be found at Dôm Goru in the Ered Mithrin. You have collected ten gold coins for Zádokh Flint-eye as he asked and should now speak to him.\n7\tFind a deposit of dragon-stone in the Bitter Scar\tDragon-stone could once be found in the depths of the Ered Mithrin and near to the lairs of dragons, but it might also be found among the Bitter Scar. Zádokh Flint-eye has asked you to find a deposit of dragon-stone in the Bitter Scar and bring a fragment of it to him.\n8\tCollect a fragment of dragon-stone\tA small deposit of dragon-stone can be found in the southernmost reaches of the Bitter Scar. You have discovered a deposit of dragon-stone and should now mine it for Zádokh Flint-eye.\n9\tDeliver the fragment of dragon-stone to Zádokh Flint-eye at Dôm Goru\tZádokh Flint-eye can be found at Dôm Goru. You have collected a small fragment of dragon-stone as Zádokh Flint-eye asked, and you should now deliver it to him at Dôm Goru and learn what else he knows of recent happenings in the Grey Mountains.\n10\tTalk to Dori at Dôm Goru\tDori can be found at Dôm Goru. After returning to Zádokh Flint-eye with the dragon-stone you discovered, he informed you that Dori and Company have come to Dôm Goru. You should speak to Dori and tell him what you have learned.\n",
[6627]="7005C8AB\n1\tFind Múta at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate\tMúta can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate. After being discovered by Dourhands at the Witch-gate, Múta was captured and the rest of her scouts were scattered. You should find Múta.\n2\tTalk to Múta at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate\tMúta can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate. Múta has been captured and imprisoned by the Dourhands at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate. You should talk to Múta.\n3\tCollect orders from the Dourhands at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate (total: 3)\tDourhands can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate. In preparation for her escape, Múta has asked you to collect orders from the Dourhands at the Witch-gate. You should defeat the Dourhands and collect their orders.\n4\tDeliver the orders to Múta at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate\tMúta can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate. You have collected orders from the Dourhands at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate. You should deliver them to Múta.\n5\tMúta's weapons can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate. Múta has asked you to return her weapons to her before attempting an escape. You should collect Múta's weapons.\t\n6\tDeliver the weapons to Múta at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate\tMúta can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate. You have recovered Múta's weapons. You should deliver them to Múta.\n",
[6628]="70061F04\n1\tQuema incienso en los túmulos (total: 8)\tNan Mabli te ha pedido que quemes incienso en las los túmulos en las Quebradas del Sur. Los túmulos se encuentran en Gond Orchal, en las Quebradas del Sur.\n2\tVuelve con Nan Mabli\tDeberías informar a Nan Mabli de que has quemado incienso en los túmulos. \\Nan Mabli está en las Quebradas del Sur.\n",
[6629]="700529D0\n1\tFind the Orc camp of Brafulug\tLúfred has asked you to stop the Orc activity in Duskenvale so trade can resume. You should find the Orc camp in the hills in Duskenvale.\n2\tDefeat Orcs in Brafulug (total: 10)\030Defeat Captain Ugúrz\tYou have discovered a camp of Orcs in northern Duskenvale. You should defeat the Orcs and their leader in Brafulug.\n3\tTalk to Lúfred\tYou have defeated the Orcs in the hills of Duskenvale. You should return to Lúfred at the Beorning Watchpost to inform him.\n",
[6630]="700330C9\n1\tEncuentra la fuente de calor que sustenta a la colmena de gredbyg\tBuscas la fuente de calor que ayuda a la colmena de gredbyg a incubar sus larvas tan rápidamente. Es probable que se encuentre en el extremo más alejado de la colmena.\n2\tComprueba el ruido que hay a la vuelta de la esquina a la derecha\tAl entrar en las Profundidades Llameantes desde las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo, escuchaste un ruido que provenía de la esquina de la derecha.\n3\tComprueba el ruido que hay a la vuelta de la esquina a la derecha\tHas encontrado la fuente de calor que sustenta a la colmena de gredbyg y, por desgracia, no hay nada que se pueda hacer para detenerla. La colmena se ha construido en el lugar perfecto de Moria para aprovechar el calor natural que generan las minas.\n",
[6631]="7000C37C\n1\tMuestra las órdenes a Elrond en Rivendel\tElrond está en la Última Morada en Rivendel, al suroeste del campamento de Glóin. Glóin se dio cuenta de que otro conjunto de órdenes escritas en Lengua Negra tardaría demasiado en traducirse y te envió a Rivendel para hablar directamente con Elrond.\n2\tEntrega las órdenes a Glóin en su campamento en las Montañas Nubladas\tGlóin está en su campamento, justo fuera de la Ciudad de los Trasgos, al noreste de Rivendel. Elrond Medio-Elfo hizo anotaciones en las órdenes y te advirtió de que los trasgos tenían un nuevo líder, un Gran Trasgo que desafiaba la intromisión de los uruks en la Ciudad de los Trasgos. Te envió de vuelta con Glóin junto con las órdenes traducidas.\n",
[6632]="70042EDE\n1\tDefeat Haradrim Raiders near the farms (total: 9)\030Hide the seed stores (total: 6)\tLossarnach's seed stores can be found in the farms north-east of Arnach. You should travel to the remaining farms to the north-east and do what you can to hide and protect the seed stores there.\n2\tTalk to Indir\tIndir can be found in Arnach, near the keep. You should return to Indir and tell him that the remaining seed stores have been safely hidden from the foe.\n",
[6633]="70043290\n1\tWar-horns sabotaged (total: 4)\tWar-horns can be found in the Haradrim camps south and east of Arnach. Indir's men have seen great warhorns in the Haradrim camps. He believes that if you sabotaged the horns, any assault on Arnach would be disorganized.\n2\tTalk to Indir\tIndir can be found in Arnach, near the keep. Indir believes that if you sabotaged the Haradrim's war-horns, any assault on Arnach would be disorganized. You should return to him and tell him this has been done.\n",
[6634]="70042EDA\n1\tTear down Haradrim message ribbons (total: 8)\tThe message ribbons can be found east and south of Arnach. Haradrim scouts seem to be tying ribbons to trees to send each other messages. You should tear down as many of these ribbons as you can.\n2\tTalk to Indir\tIndir can be found in Arnach, near the keep. Haradrim scouts were tying ribbons to trees as a means of communicating. You have torn many of them down and should return to Indir to tell him.\n",
[6635]="70017528\n1\tLleva las muestras a Glorelloth en el Refugio Sombrío.\030Recolecta piel espinosa (total: 12)\tSkûmfil se encuentra al sureste del Refugio Sombrío. Glorelloth quiere asegurarse de que los kergrim no son los responsables de la enfermedad que afecta a los orcos de la oscuridad sombría, por lo que te ha enviado a recoger muestras de la piel de los kergrim.\n",
[6636]="70048C9B\n1\tDefeat infected Orcs (total: 5)\tInfected Orcs can be found throughout Agarnaith. You should defeat infected Orcs.\n2\tCompletado\tCompletado.\n",
[6637]="70017532\n1\tDevuelve las muestras a Pentlenn en el Refugio Sombrío\030Recoge fragmentos de carne infectada (total: 18)\tLa Sala Decimosexta se encuentra al noreste del Refugio Sombrío. Deberías recoger muestras de los orcos derrotados en la Sala Decimosexta para permitir que Pentlenn observe el comportamiento de esta enfermedad. Te ha aconsejado que hagas todo lo posible por evitar infectarte tú [según el diario].\n",
[6638]="70048C95\n1\tDefeat infected troll\tInfected trolls can be found in the wilds of Agarnaith. You should defeat infected trolls.\n2\tCompletado\tCompletado.\n",
[6639]="700169CD\n1\tDerrota a los gredbyg (total: 12)\tLos gredbyg pueden encontrarse al suroeste de Guardia Orca. Kúli te ha pedido que derrotes a los gredbyg que están volviéndolo loco con sus incesantes chirridos.\n2\tHabla con Kúli\tKúli se encuentra en un campamento lejos hacia el sureste de Guardia Orca, en un pasadizo cavernoso entre las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo y las Profundidades Llameantes. Kúli se alegrará de saber que los chirridos de los gredbyg han sido acallados.\n",
[6640]="70032C35\n1\tDerrota gredbyg guerreros (total: 9)\tLos gredbyg guerreros se encuentran por toda la colmena, que ocupa el pasillo cavernoso entre las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo y las Profundidades Llameantes. El zumbido de miles de gredbyg se oye en casi todo Moria, pero es tan constante que la mayoría ni se da cuenta.\n2\tCompletado\tLa imponente colmena de gredbyg ocupa todo el pasillo cavernoso que une las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo y las Profundidades Llameantes. El zumbido sigue siendo insoportablemente fuerte en toda la colmena, pero se nota mucho más silencioso en otras partes de Moria.\n",
[6641]="7001D0CB\n1\tRecoge los braseros (total: 6)\030Quema los depósitos de aceite (total: 4)\tLos braseros y las cajas de suministros se encuentran en los fuertes orcos al norte de Gathburz. Thyrnir te ha pedido que destruyas los depósitos de aceite inflamable de los goblins prendiéndolos con los propios braseros de los trasgos.\n2\tHabla con Thyrnir en Thangulhad\tThyrnir está en Thangulhad, en Gathburz. Deberías ir a anunciarle tu éxito.\n",
[6642]="7001674E\n1\tDerrota orcos Globsnaga (total: 8)\tLos orcos de la tribu de los Globsnaga se encuentran en Dalgum-ru, al sur del Refugio Sombrío. Tyki quiere que mates a los orcos de la tribu de los Globsnaga que hay por la zona.\n2\tHabla con Tyki en el Refugio Sombrío\tTyki se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al norte de Dalgum-ru. Debes regresar a Tyki y informarle que Dalgum-ru está efectivamente infestada de orcos, y que has matado a muchos.\n",
[6643]="70071611\n1\tDestroy grodbog hives (total: 10)\030Defeat gredbyg in Gnasher's Delf (total: 12)\tThe gredbyg have infested an area to the north of the Dawn-warden called Gnasher's Delf. You should defeat gredbyg and destroy the grodbog hives with the provided explosives at Gnasher's Delf.\n2\tTalk to Ashâb\tYou have reduced the grodbog numbers at Gnasher's Delf. You should return to Ashâb at the Dawn-warden.\n",
[6644]="7004E4C0\n1\tSpeak with Tuhâl and enter Instance: The Lord of Iron\tTuhâl is waiting to speak to Lord Náin on behalf of his people. Speak with Tuhâl to enter the instance 'Lord of Iron'.\n2\tTalk to Tuhâl\tTuhâl has convinced Lord Náin to give him time to evacuate the innocent Easterlings from Utterby. You should talk to Tuhâl.\n3\tTalk to Tuhâl\tTuhâl has fashioned you a disguise! You should talk to Tuhâl.\n4\tTravel to Utterby\tNow that you have a disguise, you need to infiltrate Er Shamol. You should travel to Utterby with Tuhâl.\n5\tTalk to Tuhâl\tTuhâl is ready to infiltrate Er Shamol. You should talk to Tuhâl.\n6\tTalk to Kunchat\tKunchat, who oversees the Jangovar's operations, will put you to work. You should talk to Kunchat.\n7\tUndermine the Jangovar by completing quests in Utterby\tUtterby is currently occupied by Jangovar forces. You should complete quests in Utterby to undermine the Jangovar.\n8\tFind and free Tuhâl's family\tTuhâl's family is somewhere in Utterby. You should find and free Tuhâl's family.\n9\tTalk to Kunchat\tKunchat, who oversees the Jangovar's forces, would like to speak with you. You should talk to Kunchat.\n",
[6645]="7004AB92\n1\tCompete in the pit-fighting tournament\tPárgrub can be found near Thorzhaf. You should talk to Párgrub and compete in the pit-fighting tournament.\n",
[6646]="70001858\n1\tHabla con Dagoras\tEsteldín está al noreste de Lin Giliath, oculta en las montañas orientales entre la Dehesa del Rey y Nan Amlug. Aglardir te ha enviado con Dagoras, el capitán de la guardia de Esteldín, para informarle del paso de los Nazgûl.\n",
[6647]="7001A9A9\n1\tHabla con el Vigilante Jefe Grimbriar\tEl Vigilante Jefe Grimbriar se encuentra en su puesto fuera de Bree. Los Vigilantes Hojafrágil y Robledales creen que no se puede contener la marea a punto de estrellarse contra los muros de Andrath. Te han pedido que convenzas al Vigilante Jefe Grimbriar de que debe buscar la ayuda de los Montaraces del Norte.\n",
[6648]="7006A9EB\n1\tDeliver the letter to Porókho\tDeliver Belondor's letter to the Morutágya clan, informing them of the demise of their leader, Tumúldo Fierce-water.\n",
[6649]="700529E0\n1\tPlace goblin drawings (total: 15)\tIdeal drawing locations can be found inside Goblin-town. You should place goblin drawings in ideal drawing locations.\n2\tCompletado\tYou left some of the crude drawings at ideal locations within Goblin-town.\n",
[6650]="7006A9D7\n1\tCollect rye breads ([según el diario]/5)\tKeteph wants you to collect five loaves of rye bread for him. He intends to try to infuse his latest recipe with a different bread from the north. Rye bread requires a cook proficient in Ironfold cooking. Seek out a cook with this skill or trade for the bread at the auction house.\n2\tDeliver the rye nread to Keteph at the Swain's Guild-hall\030Collect rye breads ([según el diario]/5)\tYou have five loaves of rye to deliver to Keteph in the Swain's Guild-hall in Umbar Baharbêl.\n",
[6651]="7006A9D4\n1\tDeliver Keteph's new recipe to Taphis\030Recoge Keteph's Test Dish\030Deliver Keteph's new recipe to Hûzo\030Deliver Keteph's new recipe to Tankho\030Deliver Keteph's new recipe to Karishah in Rakhatâb\030Deliver Keteph's new recipe to Beliash in Rakhatâb\tKeteph wants discerning and brutally honest feedback from the workers of Rakhatâb. He asks that you deliver these free meals to the worker leaders there.\n2\tHabla con Keteph\tYou gathered the responses and critiques from the worker leaders in Rakhatâb. Return this information to Keteph at the Swain's Guild-hall in Umbar Baharbêl.\n",
[6652]="7006A9D5\n1\tDeliver Keteph's latest recipe to Zerkho at the Expedition Camp\030Recoge Keteph's Next Test Dish\030Deliver Keteph's latest recipe to Dorshet at the Expedition Camp\030Deliver Keteph's newest recipe to Karbah at the Expedition Camp\030Deliver Keteph's new recipe to Mallax at the Expedition Camp\030Deliver Keteph's latest recipe to Delona at the Expedition Camp\tKeteph asked that you take his deliveries to the scholars and artisans keeping busy at the expedition camp to the south-east of Umbar Baharbêl. Most are employees of the aristocrats who will be the final arbiters of his latest creation.\n2\tHabla con Keteph\tYou received nothing but goodwill and words of encouragement from the denizens of the expedition camp. It appears that Keteph's recipe is complete. Return to him at the Swain's Guild-hall in Umbar Baharbêl.\n",
[6653]="7006A9DF\n1\tCollect cabbages ([según el diario]/5)\030Collect fresh carrots ([según el diario]/5)\tKeteph asked you to find cabbages and carrots for his new dish. Apprentice farmers can grow carrots, and journeyman farmers can grow cabbages. Trade with a farmer or visit the auction house. Or, if you are lucky and patient, search the land for wild cabbages and carrots.\n2\tReturn the vegetables to Keteph at the Swain's Guild-hall\030Collect cabbages ([según el diario]/5)\030Collect fresh carrots ([según el diario]/5)\tReturn the fresh carrots and cabbages to Keteph at Swain's Guild-hall in Umbar Baharbêl.\n",
[6654]="7006A9D8\n1\tDeliver Keteph's Crab on Rye to Belondor at Dâr Laja\030Recoge Keteph's Crab on Rye\030Deliver Keteph's Crab on Rye to Hármelak at Dâr Laja\030Deliver Keteph's Crab on Rye to Khôltekh at Dâr Laja\030Deliver Keteph's Crab on Rye to Rothog at Dâr Laja\tKeteph's latest recipe is complete. He asks for your assistance one last time to deliver his creation to the Kindred at Dâr Laja. Dâr Laja, the Meeting-hall, is north of Swain's Guild-hall near the central crossroads of Umbar Baharbêl.\n2\tHabla con Keteph\tThe Kindred all seemed to enjoy the dish. You should return to Keteph and inform him of his success.\n",
[6655]="7006A9DE\n1\tCollect five loaves of Barley Bread ([según el diario]/5)\tAcquire five loaves of barley bread from cooks through trade or auction and return them to Keteph at the Swain's Guild-hall in Umbar Baharbêl. Apprentice cooks can bake Barley Bread.\n2\tReturn the loaves of Barley Bread to Keteph at the Swain's Guild-hall\030Collect five loaves of Barley Bread ([según el diario]/5)\tAcquire five loaves of barley bread from cooks through trade or auction and return them to Keteph at the Swain's Guild-hall in Umbar Baharbêl. Apprentice cooks can bake barley bread.\n",
[6656]="7006A9DD\n1\tCollect Keteph's family cruet from Phâredar in Jax Phanâl\tReturn to Jax Phânal and speak with Phâredar to retrieve Keteph's family cruet.\n2\tCollect Keteph's family cruet\tPhâredar told you that Keteph's family cruet was stolen in a raid by goblins. She suggested that you go to the encampment in the south-east to acquire the cruet from the goblins.\n3\tDeliver the cruet to Keteph at the Swain's Guild-hall\tYou recovered Keteph's family cruet from the goblins. Return the cruet to him at Swain's Guild-hall in Umbar Baharbêl.\n",
})
